  "建议按城市和主题分别维护，便于后续快速检索。": { en: "It is recommended to maintain them separately by city and topic to facilitate subsequent quick retrieval.", "zh-TW": "建議依城市和主題分別維護，以便後續快速檢索。" },
  "建议按顺序处理：1）今天先完成审批表初稿；2）明天确认课程计划与学分转换；3）后天提交院系审批并同步推荐信老师。": { en: "It is recommended to process in order: 1) Complete the first draft of the approval form today; 2) Confirm the course plan and credit transfer tomorrow; 3) Submit it to the department for approval the day after tomorrow and synchronize the recommendation letter with the teacher.", "zh-TW": "建議依序處理：1）今天先完成審核表初稿；2）明天確認課程計畫與學分轉換；3）後天提交系所核准並同步推薦信老師。" },
  "建议按证件、住宿、保险、行李等模块拆分事项。": { en: "It is recommended to split matters according to modules such as documents, accommodation, insurance, luggage, etc.", "zh-TW": "建議依證件、住宿、保險、行李等模組分割事項。" },
  "建议把目标拆成三条并行主线：一条课程主线保证数学、算法和系统基础不掉队；一条项目主线沉淀可展示作品；一条探索主线验证你对科研节奏是否适配。": { en: "It is recommended to split the goal into three parallel main lines: a main line of courses to ensure that the basics of mathematics, algorithms and systems are not left behind; a main line of projects to showcase your works; and a main line of exploration to verify whether you are suitable for the rhythm of scientific research.", "zh-TW": "建議把目標拆成三條並行主線：一條課程主線保證數學、演算法和系統基礎不掉隊；一條專案主線沉澱可展示作品；一條探索主線驗證你對科研節奏是否適配。" },
