  "聚焦大气与地球系统科学，中外合作办学特色明显，英文课程和国际科研氛围较强。": { en: "Focusing on atmospheric and earth system science, it has obvious features of Sino-foreign cooperative education, English courses and a strong international scientific research atmosphere.", "zh-TW": "聚焦大氣與地球系統科學，中外合作辦學特色明顯，英文課程及國際科研氛圍較強。" },
  "聚焦国际政治、外交与全球治理，适合关注国际议题、区域安全和国际组织的同学。": { en: "Focusing on international politics, diplomacy and global governance, it is suitable for students who are concerned about international issues, regional security and international organizations.", "zh-TW": "聚焦國際政治、外交與全球治理，適合關注國際議題、區域安全和國際組織的同學。" },
