  "连接工业工程、运筹优化、金融工程和管理决策，偏数量方法与应用管理。": { en: "Connect industrial engineering, operations optimization, financial engineering and management decision-making, partial quantitative methods and applied management.", "zh-TW": "連結工業工程、運籌優化、金融工程與管理決策，偏數量方法與應用管理。" },
  "连接光电、材料、新能源和生医交叉，强调实验平台、工程应用和跨学科协同。": { en: "Connecting the intersection of optoelectronics, materials, new energy and biomedicine, emphasizing experimental platforms, engineering applications and interdisciplinary collaboration.", "zh-TW": "連結光電、材料、新能源和生醫交叉，強調實驗平台、工程應用和跨學科協同。" },
  "连接经济分析、金融工具和企业管理，适合关注数智商业、组织决策和产业问题的同学。": { en: "Connecting economic analysis, financial tools and business management, it is suitable for students who are concerned about digital intelligence business, organizational decision-making and industrial issues.", "zh-TW": "連結經濟分析、金融工具和企業管理，適合關注數智商業、組織決策和產業議題的同學。" },
  "连接数字经济、数据资产和平台治理，适合关注数智管理和产业创新的同学。": { en: "Connecting the digital economy, data assets and platform governance, it is suitable for students who are concerned about digital intelligence management and industrial innovation.", "zh-TW": "連結數位經濟、數據資產和平台治理，適合關注數智管理和產業創新的同學。" },
  "连接信息组织、知识服务、出版传播和数据治理，兼顾信息科学与人文场景。": { en: "Connecting information organization, knowledge services, publishing and communication, and data governance, taking into account information science and humanities scenarios.", "zh-TW": "連結資訊組織、知識服務、出版傳播與資料治理，兼顧資訊科學與人文場景。" },
  "连接医疗器械、生物信号、医学成像和系统设计，是典型的医工融合学院。": { en: "Connecting medical devices, biosignals, medical imaging and system design, it is a typical medical-engineering integration school.", "zh-TW": "連接醫療器材、生物訊號、醫學影像和系統設計，是典型的醫工融合學院。" },
  "连接智能软件、大模型应用与工程落地，适合关注 AI 工程化、产品化与平台建设。": { en: "Connecting intelligent software, large model applications and engineering implementation, it is suitable for focusing on AI engineering, productization and platform construction.", "zh-TW": "連結智慧軟體、大模型應用與工程落地，適合關注 AI 工程化、產品化與平台建置。" },
