  "强调拔尖培养、大理科底座和本研贯通，适合高强度、交叉化和研究导向的学生。": { en: "It emphasizes top-notch training, a foundation in major science subjects, and comprehensive undergraduate studies, and is suitable for high-intensity, cross-disciplinary, and research-oriented students.", "zh-TW": "強調拔尖培養、大理科底座和本研貫通，適合高強度、交叉化和研究導向的學生。" },
  "强调软件工程、协作开发、测试交付与产业化落地，适合工程实践导向学生。": { en: "It emphasizes software engineering, collaborative development, test delivery and industrialization, and is suitable for engineering practice-oriented students.", "zh-TW": "強調軟體工程、協作開發、測試交付與產業化落地，適合工程實踐導向學生。" },
  "切换编辑器": { en: "Switch editor", "zh-TW": "切換編輯器" },
  "切换侧边栏": { en: "Toggle sidebar", "zh-TW": "切換側邊欄" },
