  "需要更系统地沉淀项目输出，而不是只上课或只刷题。": { en: "Project output needs to be deposited more systematically, rather than just taking classes or just answering questions.", "zh-TW": "需要更有系統地沉澱項目輸出，而不是只上課或只刷題。" },
